  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "lila",
  "description": "L\u012bla is a comprehensive benchmark for mathematical reasoning with over 140K natural language questions annotated with Python programs and natural language instructions. The data set comes with multiple splits: L\u012bla-IID (train, dev, test), L\u012bla-OOD (train, dev, test), and L\u012bla-Robust.",
